00:57:26.520 --> 00:57:30.320
<v Josh Carpatty>You come here and you tape me for your stupid friend's radio show, and then you get the hell out.
<v Josh Carpatty>你来到这儿录下我为你那个傻朋友的广播节目，然后立刻滚出去。

00:57:30.320 --> 00:57:54.430
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回归。

